  "notable_quotes": [
    "Product composition depends on synthesis conditions such as pH, temperature/pressure, and the presence of charge-balancing anions that may be incorporated.",
    "Hydrothermal reactions of 1,2,4-triazole with Zn(II)/Cd(II) salts produced 10 structurally unique M(II)/trz/Xn− materials spanning F−, Cl−, Br−, I−, OH−, NO3−, and SO42− systems.",
